  "content": "\n\n<h2>請先閱讀！重要注意事項</h2>\n<p><em>請閱讀以下內容，並在下載前<strong>備份你的世界</strong>！</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[僅限 Fabric] <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> 為必裝項目。請安裝最新版的 Fabric API（對應你的 Minecraft 版本）。\n<ul>\n<li>[僅限 Fabric] <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 為選裝項目，但可提供方便的方式來設定模組選項。</li>\n<li>[僅限 Forge] <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a>&nbsp;為必裝項目。請安裝最新版的 Architectury（對應你的 Minecraft 版本）。</li>\n<li>加入論壇發問題、建議、或 bug 回饋！<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmtrbbs.zbx1425.cn%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mtrbbs.zbx1425.cn/</a></li>\n<li><strong>此模組將不會為任何舊版 Minecraft 進行更新。</strong>&nbsp;原始碼已公開於 GitHub，因此你可以自行處理。</li>\n<li>如果你已安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transit-railway\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transit Railway</a>，請<strong>不要</strong>安裝本模組！Minecraft Transit Railway 已內建這些功能。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>如何製作電梯</h3>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vhTKectuIbg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<h3>如何製作電扶梯</h3>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QH1O-y6kPSk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<h3>準備好體驗完整功能了嗎？</h3>\n<p>現在就試試 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transit-railway\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transit Railway</a>！</p>\n<h3>發現問題了嗎？</h3>\n<p>請 <a href=\"https://github.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報你所發現的任何問題或錯誤</a>；我們將不勝感激！可前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題頁面</a>&nbsp;查看目前已知的問題。</p>\n<h3>協助翻譯此模組！</h3>\n<p>《Modern Elevators and Escalators》模組的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrwd.in%252fminecraft-transit-railway\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin 翻譯網站</a>&nbsp;已開放使用！</p>\n<p>Crowdin 是一個雲端翻譯平台，供翻譯者為專案做出貢獻。在你的幫助下，我們可以將此模組翻譯成多種不同的語言。你可以建立免費帳號來開始翻譯。</p>\n<h3>有疑問？想留言？還是想投訴？</h3>\n<p>歡迎聯繫我們。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discord:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW</a></li>\n<li>LinkedIn: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252fjonathanho33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonathanho33</a></li>\n<li>Email: <a href=\"mailto:jonho.minecraft@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">jonho.minecraft@gmail.com</a></li>\n<li>Patreon:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/join-us-on-discord.png\" alt=\"在 Discord 上加入我們\" width=\"500\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/become-a-patron-on-patreon.png\" alt=\"成為贊助者\" width=\"500\" height=\"167\"></a></p>",
